OL,5,G2100 Long Lost Family
OL,6,     FAlan Parker's painful last memory
OL,7,     Fof his mother is of her leaving
OL,8,     Fthe family home when he was five -
OL,9,     Fthe reason she left and what
OL,10,     Fhappened to her afterwards remain
OL,11,     Fa mystery that Alan's desperate to
OL,12,     Fsolve. In the second case,
OL,13,     Fseven-year-old Katherine Fletcher
OL,14,     Fwas told that she was adopted and
OL,15,     Ffelt an immediate sense of shame -
OL,16,     Falthough unfounded, that shame
OL,17,     Ffuelled a desire to find her birth
